OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells 
OL,6,Fat first in Dumfriesshire Borders and  
OL,7,FLothian with a touch of frost. Patchy  
OL,8,Frain reaching Galloway late evening    
OL,9,Fwill edge east overnight.              
OL,10,FStrengthening southeasterly winds.     
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy with some patchy       
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain this turning heavier 
OL,14,Fduring the afternoon and evening.      
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,17,Fwith further rain on Wednesday         
OL,18,Fgradually easing. Mainly dry and       
OL,19,Fbright on Thursday. Dry start Friday   
OL,20,Fthen rain arriving from the west later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
